      <title>生前纠结遗产去向却未立遗嘱 好友痛斥：别让疏远家人拿走一切</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260904/%E7%94%9F%E5%89%8D%E7%BA%A0%E7%BB%93%E9%81%97%E4%BA%A7%E5%8E%BB%E5%90%91%E5%8D%B4%E6%9C%AA%E7%AB%8B%E9%81%97%E5%98%B1-%E5%A5%BD%E5%8F%8B%E7%97%9B%E6%96%A5%E5%88%AB%E8%AE%A9%E7%96%8F%E8%BF%9C%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%E6%8B%BF%E8%B5%B0%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87/</link>
